translate fr strings:

    old "A life of only luxury and no obligation, seemed to not just relax her body but also her mind. She felt less sharp with each passing day."
    new "Une vie de luxe et d'obligations nulles semblait non seulement détendre son corps mais aussi son esprit. Elle se sentait moins tranchante avec chaque jour qui passait."

    old "A loud sound called out to her."
    new "Un bruit retentissant l'appela."

    old "A moment of silence lingered between them."
    new "Un silence s'installa entre eux."

    old "Tell a lie"
    new "Mentele"

    old "Distract him with your body"
    new "Distrais-le avec ton corps"
